'''Laboratory Island''' (ラボラ・トリ島, ''Rabora Tori-shima'', '''Labora Tori Island''') is the 28th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 77th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.9 Update|version 9.9]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
The first stage is a bit gimmicky, the second stage requires some good timing, and the fifth stage needs some luck to deal with the [[St. Dober]]s. The rest are fairly easy.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

