==Trivia==
*Laboratory Island's Japanese name, Labora Tori-shima (ラボラ・トリ島, "Labora Tori Island"), is a pun on the word ''laboratory'' and possibly [[wikipedia:Tori-shima|Tori-shima]], an uninhabited volcanic island belonging to the [[wikipedia:Izu Islands|Izu Islands]] of Japan.

